tuff waiting for you.Here’s what’s new:🎮 Three Ways to Play The demo store now has three modes. The host picks one before the game starts.Classic: the store you know. Put every toy back where it belongs.Time Attack: same goal, but now there’s a clock. The whole crew races to fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:01:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691500","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5041530-1846018067932918","game_id":"steam-5041530","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Toy Kingdom - New Store & Game Modes","summary":"Hey everyone!Since the demo went live, most of our time has gone into two big things: a whole new store to clean up, and new ways to play every store in the game. Here's what's coming.🏰 Toy KingdomYou may have already spotted our biggest store, the Shopping Mall, with its 20,000+ toys. It shows up in the trailer, and if you look through the glass in the demo store, you can catch a small piece of it on the other side. But the Mall isn't the only big store we've been building. Meet Toy Kingdom: tw","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T10:55:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932918","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5041530-1844751498221762","game_id":"steam-5041530","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Live!","summary":"Hey everyone!The closed playtest is over, and the Demo is live right now for everyone. You don't need to request access or wait for a wave. Just hit Download Demo on the store page and start putting toys away.A big thank you to everyone who joined the playtest. You played, you broke things and you told us what felt off, and the game is better because of it. Thank you for your time and for trusting us with an early build.See you in the store!Here's what we added since the playtest:🃏 Collectible C","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T14:45:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221762","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5041530-1842846814456436","game_id":"steam-5041530","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest & Dioramas","summary":"Hey everyone!First things first: the closed playtest is live. Hit Request Access on the store page and you're in the queue.We're starting small — a first group gets in right away, and bigger waves follow after that. So if you're not in the first batch, you haven't missed it. Sit tight for the next wave. DioramasMost shelves in the store are happy once every toy is in its place. A few of them want more.Dioramas are our special shelves. Each one is a whole scene taken apart and scattered around th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T17:59:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814456436","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5041530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:43:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:43:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5041530":"2026-10-26T16:43:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5041530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:43:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:43:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:43:28Z"},"5176030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:43:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:43:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":